Social Store — Website Requirements Specification (WRS)
Project Overview & Ownership
Platform Name: Social Store
Business Owners: M Hamza Tariq
Core Functionality: A high-end digital subscription marketplace. Upon opening the website, users land directly on the Subscription Services catalog with default Bahrain (BHD) pricing. Features full bilingual support (English & Arabic with LTR/RTL switching), direct WhatsApp order dispatch across two dedicated support lines, and a complaint submission module delivering directly to global2stor2@gmail.com.
Key Functional & Interface Requirements
1. Direct Entry, Fixed Localization & Language Toggle
Direct Access Landing: Opening the URL routes users directly to the Subscription Services catalog without any landing page or pre-entry modals.
Default Target Region:
🇧🇭 Bahrain (BHD) — All pricing tags display directly in Bahraini Dinar (BHD).
Bilingual Switcher (Top-Right Placement):
Location: Fixed in the top-right corner of the global header navigation bar across all device sizes.
Supported Languages: English (EN) and Arabic (AR / العربية).
Behavior: Dynamic client-side language switching without page reloads, accompanied by full LTR-to-RTL layout transitions when switching to Arabic.
Persistence: Saved in local storage.
2. Homepage & UI/UX Standards
Design Aesthetic: Dark or modern luxury palette, clean bilingual typography (Inter / Tajawal), high-contrast CTA buttons, and smooth micro-interactions.
Core Layout Sections:
Hero Section: High-converting visual showcase highlighting instant digital delivery in Bahrain.
Brand Introduction: Brief overview establishing marketplace trust under ownership of M Hamza Tariq.
Subscription Catalog Grid: Immediate display of all digital subscription cards with BHD price tags.
Customer Support & WhatsApp Showcase: Highlights direct order routing to dedicated WhatsApp lines.
Global Header & Footer: Persistent layout containers across all pages.
3. Subscription Catalog
The homepage catalog starts empty. Administrators add every service (name, English/Arabic description, prices, and photo) after publish. There is no built-in service list or bundled service artwork in the source.
4. Direct WhatsApp Ordering System & Multi-Number Logic
Checkout routes directly to customer support over WhatsApp using two configured support numbers:
Configured Support Numbers:
Line 1: +923394077636
Line 2: +97366382981
Routing Logic: Dynamic distribution (round-robin or sequential fallback) between both numbers.
Payment Method: BenefitPay, Bahrain's national e-wallet. The cart states that all payments are settled through BenefitPay before the subscription is activated.
Order Payload Format
English Payload:
Plaintext
Hello Social Store Support Team, I would like to purchase the following subscription:

Country: Bahrain
Service: [Subscription Name]
Duration: [Selected Duration: 1 Month / 1 Year]
Price: [Calculated Price in BHD]

Please provide payment details and complete my order.
Arabic Payload:
Plaintext
مرحباً فريق دعم Social Store، أود شراء الاشتراك التالي:

الدولة: البحرين
الخدمة: [اسم الاشتراك]
