السعر: [السعر بالدينار البحريني]

يرجى تزويدي بتفاصيل الدفع وإتمام طلبي.
5. Floating Support & Complaint Handling
Persistent WhatsApp Button
Floating action button (FAB) fixed on the bottom corner of all pages targeting +923394077636 or +97366382981.
Complaint Submission System
Form Inputs: Full Name, Phone Number, Subject, Complaint Details, Screenshot Upload (Required).
Target Delivery Email:
📧 global2stor2@gmail.com
Success Message: Displays an inline confirmation modal upon submission.
